# The log of the test must have a line for each of these patterns (grep -E).
# Start opens the main menu, and the controller then works the interface.
\[3\.00\].* Gamepad: mode menu
# The six positions of the focus: New Game when the menu opens, Load Game and Settings with D-pad down and the
# left stick down, Load Game and New Game with D-pad up and the stick up, and Load Game again.
\[4\.50\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=13 .* focus
\[5\.30\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=85 .* focus
\[5\.90\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=121 .* focus
\[6\.50\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=85 .* focus
\[7\.10\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=13 .* focus
\[7\.70\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=85 .* focus
# A presses Load Game, and B goes back to the main menu.
\[9\.50\].* window +MenuScreenLoadGame 
\[11\.50\].* window +MenuMain 
\[11\.50\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=85 .* focus
!\[11\.50\].* window +MenuScreenLoadGame 
